The README, issue templates, and brand images in this repository describe
Undominated.ai and exist so the public can find the product and file
corrections.

© 2026 Len van der Hof.

You may quote this README with attribution to Undominated.ai
(https://undominated.ai/). The name, the Dual Witness mark, and the
chartreuse evidence shard identify the live index. They are not a licence
to republish the catalogue.

This repository does not contain the live model catalogue, prices, or
quality scores. Those live on https://undominated.ai/. LMArena
leaderboard data used on the site is CC BY 4.0 from the official dataset.
Artificial Analysis figures are not published on the site and this
repository does not grant a sublicence to redistribute them.

